## Overview

1. This repo is a frontend SPA (single-page application) we are building for an advanced ERP (similar to Odoo) system.
2. The ERP system will be divided into the following modules:
    - PoS: The Point of Sell
    - Dashboard & Report: for the most reporting view of the system.
    - Management: for specific business management operations.
    - Inventory: all inventory operation.
    - Production: bill of Material, recipes, and production records.
    - Purchase: purchase management.
    - People: staff and client management, and related operations.
    - Gallery: product gallery with categorization.
    - Configuration: the config for the end users.
